{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20095","headline":"送豆卢策归别墅 · 孟郊","name":"送豆卢策归别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"短松鹤不巢，高石云不栖。\n君今潇湘去，意与云鹤齐。\n力买奇险地，手开清浅溪。\n身披薜荔衣，山陟莓苔梯。\n一卷冰雪文，避俗常自携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}